Alembic migration environment for the vault database.

The database URL is never fixed here — it's set at runtime from the
resolved vault path (see app/db/migrate.py::run_migrations). Generate a
new revision after changing app/db/models.py with:

    .venv/bin/alembic -c alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"

then review the generated file before committing — autogenerate is a
starting point, not a guarantee, especially for SQLite (see env.py's
render_as_batch note on ALTER TABLE limitations).
